{"version":1,"key":"article:78","content":{"id":78,"title":"人类历史上所有的危机，本质上都是分配的危机","author":"","content":[{"children":[{"text":"今天看到新闻，美国的联邦债务总额已超过 39 万亿美元，占 GDP 的比重约为 122% 至 125%。我不禁在想，为什么美国可以借这么多钱？它到底要怎么还？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ba322699-2a75-48ca-8149-2f4188b67a27","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"为了搞明白这个问题，首先要回答一个更基础的问题：钱到底是什么？它从哪里来，又为什么会变多？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3113f0da-8f26-4689-a5e7-9cb449ad1172","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这个问题背后隐藏着现代经济运行的核心逻辑：整个经济增长的引擎，其实建立在","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"​​​​​​​​​​​「借钱」","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"text":"之上。一旦理解了信贷与货币创造的秘密，很多看似遥远的宏观现象就突然变得清晰起来：美国为什么背负着天量债务却依然没有崩盘？AI 为什么被全球资本视作救命稻草？经济危机为什么总在周期性地反复发作？而当我们将这些问题抽丝剥茧，最终会得到一个结论：","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"人类历史上绝大多数危机，本质上都是分配的危机。","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"db43b7e6-b8ca-422c-8327-145be1faf7a7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"钱是怎么「变多」的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9cbc5708-0d33-4c3e-b64e-b52eaabd018f","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"很多人有一种直觉：我的钱变多了，那一定有人钱变少了，因为钱的总量是固定的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d1876a9f-74f6-4e06-9965-e40e4e8bebf6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果你这么想，说明你还停留在「金本位」的思维里。在金本位时代，钱锚定黄金，总量确实是固定的，经济就是零和博弈。但在今天的「信用货币」时代，逻辑变了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"adb726a4-8847-40fe-8b8e-c490c8afd5be","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"打个比方。你是个农民，今年种了 10 个苹果。明年你改进了技术，种出了 100 个。多出来的 90 个苹果不是从别人那里抢来的，是你通过劳动和技术凭空创造出来的。但如果市场上流通的钱还是 10 块，那 100 个苹果只能卖 1 毛钱一个，这就是「通货紧缩」。为了让价格稳定，银行系统必须配合着​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"多创造出 90 块钱","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，让 100 个苹果还能卖 1 块钱一个。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dcf241a2-a631-49c9-8df9-eb66a55b2d32","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"那这 90 块钱是谁创造的？答案不是印钞机，而是","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"​​​​​​​​​​​商业银行的贷款","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4a4f02e1-3966-4883-9bc7-f1010fdbef18","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"alt":"商业银行通过贷款创造货币的过程","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5be7c6b8-0902-458b-bd9e-bbb143533969","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777220625402_b81ce70b-d467-4978-9757-6727c6adcba4.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777220625402_b81ce70b-d467-4978-9757-6727c6adcba4.webp","width":528},{"children":[{"bold":true,"color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"​​​​​银行并不只是把已有的钱搬来搬去，贷款会在账本上创造新的存款，从而放大社会中的货币总量","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8fedf06c-b541-43e6-9946-c543761330b4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这是现代金融体系中最「魔幻」的部分。你往银行存了 100 块，银行留下 10 块当准备金，把 90 块贷给了创业者张三。这时候你的账户里依然显示 100 块，你随时可以刷卡花。而张三兜里多了 90 块现金。社会上的货币总量就从 100 块变成了 190 块。张三拿这 90 块去买设备，设备商又把钱存进银行，银行再贷出去，如此循环往复。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"27b17c7c-36fa-439b-b7d3-770d927e0d58","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"这就是​货币乘数效应","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"text":"银行不需要印纸币，只是通过「记账」，就让社会上的钱成倍增加了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2ced2661-ff98-40e2-a3de-f7f0f7d505cd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"alt":"货币乘数效应的循环放大过程","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a5e67d45-cff1-4376-a53f-2780b380da60","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777221058980_06dc97d7-a92d-4806-98f8-e5999e89dcd1.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777221058980_06dc97d7-a92d-4806-98f8-e5999e89dcd1.webp","width":528},{"children":[{"color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"一笔贷款会变成别人的存款，而这笔新存款又可以继续被银行贷出去，于是货币在一轮轮存款和贷款中被放大","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"937c3afa-deb3-4261-8388-a70212a96260","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"把刚才这套「贷款创造存款，存款继续支持贷款，货币总量被一轮轮放大」的机制，换成经济学里的说法，就叫「信用扩张」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6092c15d-37b1-4947-a595-b33222322690","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"所谓「信用扩张」，说白了就是：","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"整个社会愿意借的钱、愿意贷的钱变多了。","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"65c8e047-9d66-45c9-8c28-f17497e4fb29","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"它不是简单地印钞，而是通过一笔笔贷款发生的。银行相信借款人未来能还钱，所以愿意把钱贷出去；企业、居民或者政府相信未来有收入，所以敢把钱借进来。于是新的贷款变成新的存款，新的存款又支持下一轮贷款，社会上的购买力就被一圈圈放大。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"517cfafd-4f47-4f51-8a00-5f17ea130d7c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但信用扩张本身不等于真繁荣。这里有一个关键前提，也是区分「真繁荣」和「假繁荣」的标准：","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"借出来的钱，最后到底流向了哪里？","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b2de7f54-5946-4d09-b5f9-d0d79cf7c856","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果张三借了 90 块，拿去研发了一款大家争相购买的产品，那这 90 块「凭空创造的钱」背后就有等价的真实财富支撑，物价不会飞涨。这就是真繁荣。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a285ba22-71de-478c-a356-ea5ca1836d23","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果他拿去炒房了，钱在金融系统里转了一圈，只是把房价抬高了，并没有创造任何新的产品和服务。房价涨的时候，大家会误以为自己变富了，银行也会误以为抵押物很安全，于是继续放贷，泡沫越吹越大。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"07af9b1e-9d71-41d4-98d7-b8af47c5a85d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但一旦房价崩盘，问题就会连锁爆炸。张三还不起贷款，银行账上的这 90 块就变成了坏账。坏账意味着银行原本以为能收回来的钱收不回来了，银行自己的资本被侵蚀，于是它不敢再继续放贷，甚至会提前收紧其他人的贷款。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6cb23b8c-e723-4cdf-b5f2-bf285a625d17","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这时候，前面那个让钱成倍增加的乘数效应会反过来运转。贷款减少，新的存款就减少，社会上的钱开始收缩。企业借不到钱，投资减少，工人失业，消费下降，更多贷款还不上，更多银行坏账出现。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3938c85f-ddd3-43c5-9283-5674bcbaa3e9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"反过来，如果大家都不敢借，银行也不敢贷，这套机制就会反向运转，经济学上叫「信用收缩」。一个炒房造成的假繁荣，就会变成信用收缩、资产下跌和经济衰退的连锁反应。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3020d2e1-627c-4bbf-bf8b-09886329dc92","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这就是「资金空转」最危险的地方：它在繁荣时制造的是价格泡沫，在崩盘时留下的却是坏账和债务黑洞。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"48f6ec78-5601-4e99-945d-4e179cbe03f0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"所以，信用经济里的真繁荣，本质上是一场被真实财富支撑的信用扩张：","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"企业预期有利可图，向银行借钱扩大投资；银行通过贷款创造货币；企业用这些钱生产出新的商品、服务和就业；新增收入又变成新的消费，乘数效应由此带动整个经济飞转。","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3231c40d-4847-4795-9241-261a873bccae","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"而在这个循环里，最可怕的事情不是企业借太多钱，而是企业不借钱了。当企业对未来失去信心，不敢投资的时候，乘数效应就熄火了，经济会像一台拔掉插头的发动机慢慢停转。日本「失去的三十年」就是这个病，经济学上叫「资产负债表衰退」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c33a90cf-a764-4ee3-836a-dd4f7af2e73a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"信用扩张的接力赛","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"50473372-80cc-4667-a75d-139039634c6f","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"在一个国家里，能向银行借钱、驱动信用扩张的只有三个角色：企业、居民、政府。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1f3d5b48-2e4e-44d8-bd1b-1d7d673e0a33","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"alt":"企业、居民、政府之间的信用扩张接力","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1f7c8f30-0339-4c3a-848f-a99621018745","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777220684934_81d53457-ab05-4182-b09d-a871b4095b01.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1777220684934_81d53457-ab05-4182-b09d-a871b4095b01.webp","width":528},{"children":[{"color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"当企业不敢借钱时，居民和政府会先后接过信用扩张的接力棒，维持经济循环继续转动","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"923c49dd-1b0d-4ee3-bcfb-0044b08553e5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"当企业不敢借了，接力棒首先传给了居民。于是你看到了房贷、车贷、消费贷遍地开花。政策鼓励老百姓借钱买房买车，钱流到了开发商和制造商手里，经济循环勉强维持。但老百姓的承受力是有极限的，当工资的大半都在还房贷，六个钱包掏空的时候，这条路也断了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b6589b59-dc29-4b05-9ab7-4a82cf5dac3a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"最后只能是政府站出来。政府向市场发国债借钱，拿来修高铁、建机场、发消费券，甚至直接往老百姓账户打钱（美国疫情期间就是这么干的）。目的只有一个：强行把乘数效应重新点燃，不让经济熄火。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ad9609a4-2b3e-4ae2-bef5-ed2c24ed0b00","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这就是「凯恩斯主义」的核心主张：当私人部门不敢花钱的时候，政府必须作为「最后的消费者」挺身而出。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"41917de1-39b4-432d-8c7c-5772670730d9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但问题也跟着来了。政府花钱的效率通常不高。企业借钱是要赚回来的，有市场竞争在筛选。政府可能在深山老林里修了一条没人走的高速公路，GDP 数字是保住了，但这条路不创造任何持续的经济效益，债务却实实在在留在了账本上。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4222f743-0ce3-4f57-9a6c-ef5c633fad6a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"巨额债务为什么没压垮美国","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2f8c2e65-7ade-4db8-a151-1334c01f407f","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"这就是美国那 39 万亿债务的由来。过去这些年，为了应对 2008 年金融危机、新冠疫情等冲击，美国政府一次又一次代替私人部门扛起了信用扩张的重任。企业不借钱，政府借。老百姓不花钱，政府替你花。结果就是国家债务飙升。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b2eefdca-ec4f-4914-89bc-520379bd0443","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但对于像美国这样的主权国家来说，逻辑与普通人完全不同。美国自己就是规则的制定者，它能发行货币，能发行国债，只要全世界还愿意买它的国债，它就可以一直","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"​​​​​「借新还旧」","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cbc137d1-9aa1-4710-ba99-175d8a9ea2d1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"所以美国化解债务的逻辑从来不是 ​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"把 39 万亿变成 0","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，而是想办法降低两个比值：「债务占 GDP 的比重」，以及「利息支出占财政收入的比重」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"27d0922f-d225-4be3-889a-1fe8059bd37c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"为什么要看比值而不是看绝对数？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9b6c0b73-7234-4742-9d70-dd8100a17d85","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"想象一下，一个年入 10 万的人欠债 100 万，他已经破产了；但一个年入 1000 万的人欠债 100 万，那叫「财务杠杆」。​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"GDP 就是国家的「年收入」，只要收入涨得比债快，债就不是问题。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"819d3a1f-cea1-43c7-ba27-ebc036382ba8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"更关键的是利息。本金可以靠「借新还旧」无限循环，但利息必须用每年的税收去填。如果利息吃掉了大部分财政收入，政府连发养老金、维持军队的钱都没有，就会陷入瘫痪。所以，美国不怕债多，它怕的是「经济不长」和「利息太高」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ac75fc33-cb01-47cd-9cd1-6ad929e2ca4f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"那怎么降低这个比值呢？历史上主要有四条路：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b14e5ccf-52d9-41a7-a620-0d3d050568e5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"经济高增长","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：这是最理想的一条路。二战刚结束的 1946 年，美国债务占 GDP 比重高达 119%。但随后赶上了 50 到 60 年代的经济大繁荣，到了 70 年代，债务的绝对数字几乎没降，但占 GDP 的比重已经掉到了 30% 左右。分子没变，分母变大了，自然就稀释了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f0840174-4af9-455b-b487-89ee7558e10d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"66f8dc3f-cc87-45c7-b0c9-808f689c237b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"温和通胀","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：这条路最隐蔽。让通胀率保持在 3% 到 4%，同时把国债利率压到 2%。你的钱每年贬值 4%，政府只付你 2% 的利息，中间那 2% 的差价就是政府从债权人手里悄悄拿走的。时间拉长，债务的实际购买力会大幅缩水。经济学上管这叫「金融压抑」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e8158a43-c85c-4cc8-a19b-228d3bd12605","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"32e08eff-7511-4446-ab12-263ca3bc44a4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"财政紧缩","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：加税、砍福利、减开支。但在美国的选举体制下几乎走不通，任何想大幅加税或削减养老金的政客都会被选票淘汰。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"34028ca3-215e-434b-92d6-730cfe666cb6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ebfd6357-4692-4d50-8853-52b3089657e7","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"债务违约","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：直接赖账。但这意味着美元信用体系彻底崩盘，属于核按钮级别的选项。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ba6b19aa-0031-4ecc-b655-255f1277c0e8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"2d51cfc2-1a40-4a09-88b6-78683eac34c8","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"4e10025b-cacc-429f-8d0a-6e5cfb2822d7","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"所以美国实际在走的，是前两条路的混合：拼命发展经济做大分母，同时通过央行操作悄悄稀释债务。而它当前最大的赌注，就是 AI 能不能带来一次类似互联网时代的生产力大爆发。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e74f489d-2d77-42bb-b531-c79689d3f5e1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"问题的根源是分配","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8d18a377-1efb-4f3e-816a-3f2e5fc7f017","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"要想让政府退出来减少债务，唯一的办法就是让企业重新成为借钱的主力军。而要让企业重新敢借钱，它必须看到足够大的利润空间。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ef7814cd-8548-4539-985e-65914b212744","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但翻开历史书你会发现一个让人震惊的模式：几乎每一次大的经济危机，社会上的「东西」都是够的，甚至是过剩的。问题出在需要这些东西的人手里没有钱。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6c52eaba-7b93-4c99-ba5f-c24b5151d185","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"1929 年美国大萧条，一边是城市里成千上万的穷人排着长队领救济汤，饿得皮包骨头。另一边是农场主把成吨的鲜牛奶倒进密西西比河，把小猪扔进河里淹死，把玉米当柴火烧。为什么不把牛奶送给穷人？因为运费比牛奶本身还贵，农场主赔不起。这不是因为社会生产不出牛奶，而是因为在之前的经济循环中，工人的工资被持续压低，金融泡沫把财富集中到了少数人手里。当泡沫破裂，占人口绝大多数的工人阶层丧失了购买力，牛奶就只能倒掉。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eac76e83-6abd-49bd-a21e-4f9d7c135ffb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"中国古代的王朝周期律也是一样。每一个封建王朝都遵循类似的轨迹：开国初期均田免赋，百姓安居乐业。然后几百年和平发展下来，地主通过高利贷和巧取豪夺把大量土地集中到自己手中，失地农民变成佃农，交完地租连饭都吃不饱。最终农民起义爆发，王朝覆灭，土地重新平分，循环重启。粮食的总产量没有减少，减少的是农民手里的「分配份额」。战争，就是人类历史上最惨烈的「强制重新分配」手段。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b0262bf0-6729-4296-a8dd-2e5aabba59ab","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"今天的大城市也是一样。一边是夜晚漆黑一片的空置豪宅和「鬼城」新区，一边是年轻人掏空六个钱包也买不起一套小房子。我们缺钢筋水泥吗？缺建筑工人吗？我们的建筑能力可以给每个人盖一栋别墅。但房子从「居住品」变成了「金融投资品」，信贷资源和财富向少数人高度集中，导致了「产能过剩」和「需求不足」同时存在的魔幻局面。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"87106b44-6ea6-4137-9627-48a4d898eab1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这三个跨越千年的场景，底层逻辑完全相同：","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"不是蛋糕不够大，而是切蛋糕的刀歪了。","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"da38c64f-862c-427d-9429-97cd49e9a824","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"alt":"","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b1e67d54-9412-41f9-8437-12348cbd4afa","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1fd33d07-1c59-44ff-8962-ceb1c2b11ee2.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1fd33d07-1c59-44ff-8962-ceb1c2b11ee2.webp","width":528},{"children":[{"color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"产能过剩和需求不足可以同时存在，因为真正出问题的往往不是生产能力，而是财富和购买力的分配方式","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eee82e7c-a02c-47ce-a5f7-f454c6b8c003","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"危机为什么总在重演","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"501cc91e-91ba-4cf7-b1a5-a53ac8bb8859","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"理解了「分配」这个底层逻辑之后，经济危机的周期性就很好解释了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ff1eac7b-5b58-4640-abc6-7d709887c3ff","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"繁荣","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：科技进步或制度革新带来生产力爆发，社会财富快速增长。蛋糕在急速膨胀，哪怕切法不太公平，大家分到的绝对量都在增加，所以没人抱怨。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3493f81e-e379-4c37-960b-97c81b812deb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3fe0a615-90e4-43a3-9f19-9b00c3600613","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"分化","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：资本天然具有「马太效应」，有钱的人可以用钱生钱，而普通劳动者只能靠工资。随着时间推移，财富向资本方高度集中。蛋糕虽然还在变大，但增量的绝大部分都被顶层拿走了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"62f8219f-966f-4dc9-b5ae-728e4776ca04","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8de70cb4-45b3-4c6f-8563-5308febe43c4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"泡沫","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：顶层手里的钱太多，实体经济消化不了，于是资金涌入金融市场，炒高房价、股价和各种金融衍生品。GDP 看起来很漂亮，但这是假繁荣，底层的真实购买力并没有同步增长。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5a7afb44-e8c2-4165-9913-3bb02ff67094","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c383df03-1ef9-434c-917e-171f71550b6e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"崩溃","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：泡沫终究会破裂。资产价格暴跌，债务链条断裂，银行出现坏账，信用急剧收缩。企业裁员，消费萎缩，形成可怕的「通缩螺旋」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3ab5a4bf-2240-41b2-a052-a3dd503ffb55","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ed9fbe28-418a-4605-8bea-a5fafb694ff5","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"重置","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：危机之后，要么通过政策（比如罗斯福新政）进行温和的财富再分配，要么通过更剧烈的方式（革命、战争）强行洗牌。然后新的周期开始。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5c349487-fb3d-4dd5-a6aa-b16ddf1c8e96","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"a9d3d5a1-ab42-40fe-8f79-e6c7a4da324f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"d82278b7-f14a-441a-8504-e5e7a351af64","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"二战后的「黄金三十年」就是第五幕之后的新一轮第一幕。互联网革命带来的 90 年代繁荣也是第一幕。2008 年金融危机是第四幕。我们今天站在哪一幕？大概在第三幕和第四幕之间的某个位置。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cb793f17-ed5b-4425-8d93-eb0654cb4781","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"每一次科技爆发，本质上是在做大蛋糕来掩盖分配不公的矛盾。只要蛋糕膨胀的速度够快，大家分到的绝对量在增加，就没有人会闹事。但如果有一天科技停滞了，蛋糕不再变大了，被掩盖的分配矛盾就会彻底暴露。这时候要么改革，要么就是战争和王朝更替，然后一切重新来过。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"67f11afc-d894-4a36-885b-09b08cbe99f9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"这个循环已经转了几千年了。","textGradient":"ocean","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5a4cf01e-3a64-45bb-928f-c3bb1b4d9c35","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"马克思的预言","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c01f326d-5e8f-4511-b10f-10ea62170c6c","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"讲到这里，几乎不可能绕开一个人：卡尔·马克思。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4b874b40-3c5f-4317-8f96-738802030acd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"马克思在 150 多年前就在《资本论》中指出了这个问题。他的核心逻辑是这样的：资本家为了在竞争中存活，必须不断提高效率，引进机器、压低工资。这导致两个同时发生的结果，一方面商品的产能越来越高，另一方面工人的购买力越来越弱。当生产能力远远超过消费能力时，商品卖不出去，危机就爆发了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0cde8463-c172-491c-b33b-a5de49e86ca7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"italic":true,"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"马克思认为这个矛盾在资本主义框架内是无解的。","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 因为只要生产资料归私人所有，资本家就必然会追求利润最大化，就必然会压榨工人，就必然会导致分配失衡。所以他提出了一个终极方案：共产主义。生产资料归全社会所有，生产的目的不是为了利润，而是为了满足人的需求。既然没有了「利润」的驱动力，也就不存在「生产过剩」和「消费不足」的矛盾。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a20e8845-15d3-4418-a5cf-2a75db737c69","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但历史也告诉我们，在生产力还不够发达的时候，强行推行公有制会带来严重的效率问题。「干多干少一个样」会导致没人愿意努力。所以马克思自己也说过，共产主义必须建立在生产力高度发达的基础上。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"da263886-66f1-473a-bd04-a3f6819d53c4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"有意思的是，AI 可能恰好就是那把钥匙。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43f772af-7a61-4438-879f-57e4a8266615","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"AI 的致命悖论","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"952639bb-8c33-4815-9875-dd524cd1593a","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"​要化解眼下的债务死局，唯一的出路就是找到一种能让生产力呈指数级爆发的新技术。这就是为什么华尔街和全球资本对 AI 如此狂热的原因，他们真正在乎的不是 AI 能不能写诗画画，而是 AI 能不能成为一台史无前例的「财富印钞机」。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7ab814dc-8374-4a86-947b-3e8226ac36ec","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"​","type":"formatted"},{"text":"AI 的核心经济价值，在于它极大地降低了「智能」的边际成本。当各行各业的生产效率因为 AI 而翻倍甚至翻十倍时，社会创造的真实财富总量就会暴增。只要 AI 能带来一场全要素生产率的大爆发，把 GDP 这个分母做得足够大，那么 39 万亿的债务占比自然就会被稀释到一个安全的水平。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dad8f7ba-fac5-40ed-bab9-fe21e7c7c9be","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​但这里藏着一个致命的悖论。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3cc45882-e292-402a-b996-82ea09729461","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​AI 在「生产端」创造了巨大价值，但在「消费端」可能同时制造了一个黑洞。","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"如果 AI 替代了大量人类工作，普通人失去了收入来源，那谁来买 AI 生产出来的东西？","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"120c82f3-725b-4d67-95eb-e9dd9a7d765e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"alt":"","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9510d136-ba1d-491b-9b3a-06ff61a3f2e9","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_09138415-ed8c-4041-8e1e-c992a535d7d0.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_09138415-ed8c-4041-8e1e-c992a535d7d0.webp","width":528},{"children":[{"color":"#8f959e","darkColor":"#757575","italic":true,"text":"如果生产效率暴增的收益只流向资本方，而普通劳动者失去工资收入，生产、工资、消费、再生产的循环就会被打断","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2086eed8-64df-4a13-8fb6-964f9cabb3ba","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这不是科幻故事，是正在发生的事。客服被聊天机器人替代了，翻译被大模型替代了，初级程序员被 Agent 替代了。企业的利润确实提高了，但这些利润流向了拥有 AI 的资本方，而不是被替代掉的那些工人。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"be74a9a8-96cd-42cd-9816-5ecad107f4eb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​当工人（也就是消费者）的收入减少，他们的消费预期就会减弱。消费减弱意味着企业的产品卖不出去，企业亏损，投资停滞，乘数效应再次熄火。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"90a44f61-6759-40c2-9510-319472ee4205","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​以前的技术替代的是人类的「体力」或者「简单脑力」，人还可以往更复杂的脑力劳动转型。而 AI 替代的恰恰是人类最引以为傲的「智能」本身。如果连复杂的思考、创作、决策都被机器做了，人还能往哪里转型？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b4101c1c-a83c-4309-8882-aeb58f19b8b3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​所以 AI 的核心风险不在于技术不行，而在于它可能彻底打断「生产 → 工资 → 消费 → 再生产」这条经济循环的链条。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e30d8e0c-8a8c-482b-99e4-3542be4e1e4f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"AI 与共产主义的交汇","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6f672841-735b-47ad-8c3e-2ad8ded5d178","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"换一个角度来看 AI。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dee56dcd-9acc-4be9-8d42-2eb3d91e510c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"AI 正在做的事情，本质上是在消灭稀缺。当 AI 机器人可以种地、做饭、盖房子、看病、写代码，生产成本趋近于零的时候，食物、住房、医疗、教育这些基本生活资料的价格也会趋近于零。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f75e839e-de1a-49b1-980b-f69872dbb453","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果人类生存所需的一切都变得几乎免费，那「钱」这个东西本身就失去了最核心的功能。这不就是马克思所设想的「物质极大丰富」的前提条件吗？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"14e7ab9b-fe6b-468a-b668-55014dc5d0cb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"目前全球最前沿的经济学讨论，围绕着几个方案：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f1d58710-f693-4038-8106-e32b14816c41","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"全民基本收入，对 AI 企业征收重税，然后把收益平均分给每一个公民","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"096345b2-40bd-4bdf-b17b-1d86f53015af","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"d5fb6fcd-13ef-4d25-a58a-f9de9d0155e6","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"商品免费化，如果 AI 把生产成本压到了接近于零，生活成本会降得更快","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c174a6aa-4dec-44cc-809b-b9aa91926aaa","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"43c8f605-21e2-4279-8a43-796970f35221","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"缩短工作时间，AI 干了 80% 的活，人类每周只需要工作一两天。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4a260d0e-c8bf-4cb6-9314-6249ad72b869","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"0428a42b-d447-4057-bbeb-3830ff75628a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"a2c71f72-8f21-4ee5-b57e-1c11b7c06700","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"这些方案虽然披着「资本主义改良」的外衣，但内核已经无限接近于马克思描绘的共产主义愿景了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1ab0be56-0846-4a23-9757-8685313bc61b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"这就引出了一个深刻的悖论。​","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"资本主义的逻辑建立在「稀缺」之上，东西因为稀缺才有价格，有价格才有利润，有利润资本家才投资。但 AI 的终极目标恰恰是「消灭稀缺」","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。当稀缺不存在时，价格体系就会瓦解，利润就会消失，整个资本主义的底层逻辑就会被掏空。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4333edb4-e61a-4edc-a604-079423e86467","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"换句话说，AI 做到极致，资本主义可能会自动「变异」成某种形式的共产主义。不是因为革命，不是因为战争，而是因为技术发展的必然逻辑。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"95a18f94-21ec-42b6-bbf5-23a975b18c88","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"最后的竞速","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"adf2e230-06d8-435f-98c2-e917ec3213d8","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"当然，这一切的前提是我们能安然无恙地走到那一步。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"55dca423-02d3-4c55-a94c-164da69cfd12","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"回到现实，美国乃至全人类正在面对的，是一场生死时速的赛跑。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6a8800a9-a8cf-46ca-abb7-f6b826c6912f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"一边是债务雪球。美国国债超过 39 万亿美元，每年仅利息支出就超过 1 万亿，比军费还高。利息滚利息，这个雪球即使什么都不做也在自动膨胀。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7d3a667f-f333-4fc8-be93-81e10bef6713","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"另一边是 AI 革命。人类把筹码押在了以 AI 为代表的新一轮技术革命上，赌它能像蒸汽机、电力、互联网一样带来生产力的指数级飞跃。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"447a7f4f-2218-4394-9a7d-12d5dc575afb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果 AI 跑赢了债务，GDP 暴增，税收暴增，39 万亿在未来庞大的经济体量面前被稀释成一个可承受的数字，同时社会探索出新型分配机制，避免消费端断裂。人类进入一个不需要为生存发愁的新阶段。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b619374b-af5c-407d-a414-72d8c822778e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果债务跑赢了 AI，AI 被证明还远未成熟，或者只是又一个泡沫。企业烧光了投资却没造出等价的真实财富，债务雪球压垮政府财政，恶性通胀或者债务违约爆发，全球金融海啸。更可怕的是，在分配极度不均的社会里，失业潮叠加金融崩溃，极端主义和民粹主义将全面抬头。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"741b088c-1817-49c8-a313-c9acb11df93c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"把这条逻辑链走完，我最大的感触是：","type":"formatted"},{"text":"​","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"人类的悲剧，往往不是因为我们无能，而是因为我们无法合理地分享。","textGradient":"rose","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1c903aa0-a2f9-4d5e-b181-e993d7455d78","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"从古代的土地兼并到现代的金融收割，从大萧条的倒牛奶到今天的空置豪宅，从蒸汽机到 AI，生产力一直在进步，但分配的难题从未真正被解决。每一次科技爆发只是暂时掩盖了矛盾，每一次泡沫破裂又把它重新撕开。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0653ed16-c9aa-458a-ae9a-82c58af141da","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"​AI 给了人类一个前所未有的机会，第一次，我们有可能从根本上消灭物质匮乏。但它也提出了一个前所未有的挑战：当「生产」不再需要人的时候，「分配」的公平性将成为文明能不能继续走下去的唯一命门。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"af0191e9-4ea5-456b-b507-c68dba6d5df1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-mlwg7k_8fa536ea-9f67-4a75-9acb-ace5a87af509.webp","createTime":1777212129482,"updateTime":1793532632199},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1793532632199}}